! Goggle Name: MetaStock Core Content Only
! Description: Focuses on www.metastock.com, strictly discarding utility and specific product paths.

! --- ALLOW/BOOST THE MAIN SITE ---
! This rule ensures the domain is indexed and boosted.
|https://www.metastock.com^$boost=5

! --- BLOCKED UTILITY PATHS (from image) ---
! The asterisk (*) is used as a wildcard to block entire sub-directories.
www.metastock.com/css*$discard
www.metastock.com/js*$discard
www.metastock.com/api*$discard
www.metastock.com/search*$discard
www.metastock.com/sitemap.xml$discard
www.metastock.com/rss*$discard

! --- BLOCKED PRODUCT PATH (from user text) ---
! Confirmed cutoff rule from user request.
www.metastock.com/products/realtime/eikon*$discard
